---
---
<section id="features" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="s-label reveal">Features</span>
    <h2 class="s-head reveal d1">Crafted for Pure Listening</h2>
    <p class="s-sub reveal d2">Everything you need to enjoy, discover, and own your music library without commercial interference.</p>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feat-card reveal d1">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Ad-Free Music Streaming</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Search and stream any song or music video instantly from YouTube Music. Zero advertisements, unrestricted high-fidelity audio, and pure extraction via a native Rust backend.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d2">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">High-Speed Downloader</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Save any track or playlist directly to your drive in high-bitrate MP3, Opus, or M4A format with bundled ffmpeg. Complete with automatically embedded ID3 tags and high-resolution album art.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d3">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Synced and Romanized Lyrics</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Real-time scrolling lyrics synchronized to playback with an immersive full-screen Theater Mode. Includes automated Romanization transliteration for Japanese, Korean, and Chinese tracks.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d1">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Listen Together</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Host or join real-time synchronized listening sessions with friends. Share queues and enjoy the exact same music in perfect lockstep from anywhere.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d2">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">In-App Track Comments</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Read and explore community discussions directly inside the music player as you listen. Connect with how fellow listeners feel about each track.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d3">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="21" x2="4" y2="14"/><line x1="4" y1="10" x2="4" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="20" y1="21" x2="20" y2="16"/><line x1="20" y1="12" x2="20" y2="3"/><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="7" y2="14"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/><line x1="17" y1="16" x2="23" y2="16"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Tempo and Pitch Controls</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Fine-tune your audio with precision tempo adjustment, real-time pitch shifting, variable playback speeds from 0.5x to 2.0x, sleep timers, and gapless transitions.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d1">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><polyline points="8 7 3 12 8 17"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="15" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Playlist Import and Export</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Effortlessly migrate your library: import Spotify playlists via Exportify CSV or paste any public YouTube playlist URL for automated track matching.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d2">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Listening Stats and Scrobbling</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">Gain deep insights into your listening habits with interactive charts and time-of-day breakdowns. Integrated dual scrobbling for Last.fm and ListenBrainz, plus Discord Rich Presence.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat-card reveal d3">
        <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-title">Zero Telemetry and Privacy</div>
        <div class="feat-desc">No tracking scripts, no analytics, no cookies, and zero telemetry. Your playlists, history, and listening stats live strictly on your own device in an encrypted local database.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
